@page id="b2-canon" rh="BACK MATTER · THE CANON REGISTER" m="DECIDED; FINAL RULINGS; RULING; VOL. I · {v1:canon}"
# What's fixed
Everything here is canon until you overrule it. The Final Rulings outrank every source file, and your own rulings outrank the rest. Volume One's register is on page {v1:canon} of that volume.
tabrl:
| Item | Ruling | Where it lands |
| Zion's age | DECIDED: Eighteen at chapter one, born 2085 (Ruling, October 23, 2026). SUPERSEDED: Nineteen (MEN). | Zion, the household tree |
| Solomon's age | DECIDED: Sixteen, born 2088. SUPERSEDED: Thirteen (TL). | Solomon |
| Leah | DECIDED: Twenty, younger than Eden, and she sat for an assessment | Leah |
| Thomas | Left voluntarily in 2084 (FR 3) | Thomas, Miriam |
| Miriam | Reassigned after Thomas left (FR 0). Celeste has no proof she's alive (FR 16). | Miriam, Celeste |
| Solomon's father | The man Miriam was reassigned to (FR 0) | Solomon |
| The Prelate | POSSIBLE: Working name Aurelia. Never Huldah or Naomi (FR 33). | The Prelate |
| Crest | Dorian's uncle (FR 35) | Dorian, the tree |
| Dorian | Fifty-nine (Ruling) | Dorian |
| Calla | Surname Merritt (Ruling) | Calla |
| Lyris | Never called anything else (WR 32) | Lyris |
| The eleven | Married down the elite ladder. Nobody goes home unassigned (FR 19). | Part III |
| Children | Classified by household registration (FR 32) | Naomi, the Osei children |

